WEBVTT

1
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,520
Even though the person in front of me is wearing sunglasses

2
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,120
Also taller and stronger than before

3
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,600
But I will never admit my mistake

4
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,760
This is number one

5
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,600
That strong sense of oppression made me groan.

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,910
What are you doing here?

7
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:36,310
The person in front of me is undoubtedly in the hands of the stronghold.

8
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:37,600
This is such a powerful zombie

9
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,880
Why follow his orders?

10
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,700
Kill the steel-sided zombies first

11
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,540
It’s better to drag the strong man in front of you into the fire first.

12
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:45,820
I am Yan Guang from the Artist Base

13
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,860
May I ask who is in charge of this operation?
